# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_6000002> (arthropod tagma)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "doi:10.1016/B978-0-12-385026-3.00024-3") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_6000002> "One of the main divisions of the whole organism of arthropods formed from groups of segments.")
