AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_6000002> "Strictly speaking the term \"tagma\" cam be used for any metameric organism, however we follow the common usage which is to restrict the term to arthropods.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_6000002> "arthropod tagma")
